    "label_names": [],
    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JMZD0EJHFZPRRCZGMT6YJPWN\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to view and configure the settings for a flow email which includes settings such as Smart Sending and UTM tracking.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMZD0EJJ3RTC066NB6R1Y5QB\">Review a flow email’s settings</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click on an email card within a flow.</li>\n<li>View the <strong>Settings</strong> section at the bottom of the righthand sidebar. You'll see the following settings:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Skip recently emailed profiles<br></strong>Decide whether you would like to turn <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002779311-Smart-Sending-for-Flows\" target=\"_self\">Smart Sending</a><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"> on or off for a particular email, which skips recently emailed profiles.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Enable UTM Tracking </strong><br>Decide whether you would like to turn on <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005247808-UTM-Tracking-in-Klaviyo\" target=\"_self\">UTM Tracking</a> for a particular email. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Additional filters</strong><br>Add <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002779091-Add-an-Additional-Filter-to-a-Single-Flow-Email\" target=\"_self\">additional filters</a> that apply exclusively to a particular email. This can be a useful tool if you would like to restrict an email to a particular group of people without creating an entirely separate path for them to go down using a conditional split.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34374261791131\" width=\"365\" height=\"311\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMZD0EJJJAPYT3JSQT3YFA1W\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">Additional resources</h2>\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002779271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">managing flow messages</a>. </p>\n<p>See how to pause flow messages: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360048376172\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to bulk update flow statuses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002779291\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to pause an individual flow message</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
